        "slc_fb9545fd993d662382aa43cf1a69d482e16a72b6f8b3d6a26fd1c99ff9a72008"
      ],
      "text": "The platform lets users chain multiple LLMs together to build generative AI applications without coding, via a no-code builder."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_82a5924e8a6fa220f2a908c991e5dd8c431f13a529bbedf7d6c64da678a2a9f8",
