        "slc_e0a863d14206b3e5e1f2e5dc647fc38e22750c9cf2f413c2a6935d669c4b161e"
      ],
      "text": "Running jobs requires a background Docker container, so Docker must be installed on the machine to use the jobs feature."
    },
